

### Create AI full plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/suggestions/full-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "BODY_RECOMPOSITION",
  "experienceLevel": "BEGINNER",
  "activityLevel": "MODERATE",
  "workoutDaysPerWeek": 4,
  "workoutDurationMinutes": 60,
  "userNote": "Muốn giảm mỡ bụng, tăng cơ nhẹ, không có chấn thương"
}

### Get my AI suggestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/suggestions/my?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get AI suggestion detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/suggestions/{{aiSuggestionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Submit feedback
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/suggestions/{{aiSuggestionId}}/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Kế hoạch dễ hiểu và phù hợp"
}